{
  "id": "gift-with-purchase-europe",
  "name": "Gift with purchase (Europe)",
  "category": "retailer_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Cards given away with Pokémon TCG purchases at shops in Europe, many from an expansion's launch day, each with its logo on the picture: Moltres for Team Up from 1 February 2019, Melmetal for Unbroken Bonds from 3 May 2019, Solgaleo for Cosmic Eclipse from 1 November 2019, Mewtwo for Brilliant Stars from 25 February 2022 and Hisuian Zoroark for Lost Origin from 9 September 2022, up to Yveltal for Mega Evolution, between 10 October and 14 November 2025. The countries and shops varied from card to card, among them Game Mania in the Netherlands and Belgium, WHSmith and Smyths in the United Kingdom and King Jouet in Belgium and France; GameStop and EB Games gave some of the same cards with their own logos.\n\nFrom Paldea Evolved in 2023, oversize copies with the expansion's logo were gifts with purchase in Europe too, among them Chien-Pao ex, Charizard ex, Garchomp ex and Terapagos ex.",
